          "description": "Drift off to dreamland with this gentle collection of timeless lullabies, carefully chosen to help little ones relax, unwind, and settle into a calm bedtime routine. Soft melodies and familiar lyrics create a comforting atmosphere that makes bedtime feel safe and soothing for children of all ages.\n\nThis Yoto Card features a handpicked selection of beloved lullabies, including classics like Golden Slumbers,&nbsp;Rock-a-bye Baby,&nbsp;Starlight, Starbright, and&nbsp;Hush, Little Baby. These songs have been passed down through generations, and their simple beauty continues to bring comfort and calm at the end of a busy day.\n\nWhether you're rocking a newborn to sleep or helping a toddler wind down after a long day, this collection offers a peaceful soundtrack for quiet evenings. Play it as part of your nightly routine to signal that it’s time to slow down, snuggle up, and drift gently off to sleep.",
